i-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">9.10<br/>July 6, 2011<br/>Summer Update 2011</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>Located near <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>, it seems to be an outpost of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Steamship\">Steamship</a> route between Kazordoon and <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>. This is a good hunting place for <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">paladins</a>, since <a href=\"#/wiki/Deepling%20Scout\">Deepling Scouts</a> drop a lot of Hunting Spears. There are 50 of them in these mines.\n</p><p>This area is part of the <a href=\"#/quest/awash-world-change\">Awash World Change</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>NPCs in Sunken Mines</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dronk\">Dronk</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dronk\"><img alt=\"Dronk\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dronk_548de1.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Foreman</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\">South-west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Junkar\">Junkar</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Junkar\"><img alt=\"Junkar\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Junkar_3654be.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Ship Captain</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\">Near the <a href=\"#/wiki/Steamship\">Steamship</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32366,32202,13\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32366, 32202, 13)</a>), <a href=\"#/wiki/Robson%27s%20Isle\">Robson Isle</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32526,32036,14\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32526, 32036, 14)</a>) and <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Sunken Mines</strong> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32555,32068,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32555, 32068, 10)</a>).</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Monsters in Sunken Mines</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Deepling%20Scout\"><img alt=\"Deepling Scout\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Deepling_Scout_4e536a.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Deepling%20Scout\">Deepling Scout</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">160</td><td style=\"text-align: c